#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<index>()  is identical to B<strchr>(3)."
msgstr "B<index>() ist identisch zu B<strchr>(3)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<rindex>()  is identical to B<strrchr>(3)."
msgstr "B<rindex>() ist identisch zu B<strrchr>(3)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Use B<strchr>(3)  and B<strrchr>(3)  instead of these functions."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie B<strchr>(3) und B<strrchr>(3) anstelle dieser Funktionen."

